==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|gml|de}} {{term|vet|lang=gml}}, from {{etyl|osx|de}} {{m|osx|*fētid}}, from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*faitidaz}}. Replaced {{etyl|de|-}} {{term|feist|lang=de}}, from {{etyl|goh|-}} {{term|feizit|lang=goh}}, from the same root.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/fɛt/|lang=de}}

===Adjective===
{{de-adj|er|fettesten}}

# [[fat]]
#: '''''Fette''' Menschen sind oft ungesund.''
#:: '''Fat''' people are often unhealthy.
# {{context|colloquial|lang=de}} [[awesome]]
#: ''Das war echt '''fett'''.''
#:: This was really '''awesome'''.
#: ''Sie hat 'nen '''fetten''' Vertrag an Land gezogen.''
#:: She got a very '''profitable''' contract.
# (of a font) [[bold]]

